########## 05-overflow.sh ##########
fs.fanotify.max_queued_events = 16384 (read-only in this lab — not lowered)
burst size N = 21384 (max_queued_events + margin of 5000); each touch generates 2 raw fanotify events (CREATE, CLOSE_WRITE), so this run queues roughly 42768 raw events against a 16384-event queue

