== btrfs subvolume mounted separately from its root (the EXDEV question) ==
Create subvolume '/lab/8-a1/mnt/btrfsdisk/sub1'
-- fanotify_mark(FAN_MARK_FILESYSTEM) against the separately-mounted subvolume --
journal exit code: 1
