RESULT: fanotify_mark FAILED on the separately-mounted subvolume (see stderr above) — if this is EXDEV, it confirms the issue's upstream research; whatever the exact errno, a data disk laid out as a btrfs subvolume distinct from its root needs its own FAN_MARK_FILESYSTEM call per subvolume mount, not one mark on the root covering all of them.

